# The agent trace store is local, per-developer and regenerable.
# It holds run inputs/outputs; nothing in it belongs in the repository.
agent/observability/runs/

# The contract record store, on the same reasoning: one JSONL file per run,
# records appended and never rewritten. These are an agent's findings, not the
# legal record — data/ is the legal record, and a contract record never goes
# there. Regenerable by re-running the agent; nothing in it is committed.
agent/runs/
